title: Decide what tls/cert_path mean
updated: 2026-08-24T04:20:59Z
---

Both attributes exist on API::Docker, are documented as experimental, and are read by nothing: Role::HTTP always builds a plaintext IO::Socket::INET for tcp://. Either implement TLS (IO::Socket::SSL, cert/key/ca from cert_path, DOCKER_TLS_VERIFY) or drop the attributes and say plainly that tcp:// is plaintext only. Leaving them as-is advertises a capability that does not exist.
